#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/basic-DFN-2d.ipynb:184
msgid ""
"There is no lithium plating in this model. However, at the end of the "
"constant current charge, the negative electrode potential difference in the "
"area near the defect goes below 0 and the surface stoichiometry becomes 1, "
"which are the two conditions required for lithium plating to happen."
msgstr ""

